      "content": "Note that ‘SFT v3+v4’ has higher scores on all tasks compared to ‘SFT v3’, and the gap is especially large for ARC (+1.45) and GSM8K (+2.43). 5 Conclusion Surprisingly, the two models perform similarly in terms of H6. A closer look at the scores for the individual tasks shows only a small margin in the GSM8K scores, and other task scores show little difference. Thus, the performance gaps in certain tasks in the SFT base models do not always carry over to the alignment-tuned models."
